---
import AppLayout from '../layouts/AppLayout.astro';
---

<AppLayout title="Privacy Policy">
  <main class="shell legal-page">
    <article class="panel legal-card">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="legal-updated">Last updated August 11, 2026</p>

      <section>
        <h2>Information Mimi collects</h2>
        <p>Mimi collects the information needed to provide the service:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            account information, including your username, email address, and a
            protected password credential;
          </li>
          <li>
            learning activity, including your course, lesson progress, answers,
            review history, XP, and streaks; and
          </li>
          <li>
            profile information and other content you choose to submit.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          If you learn as a guest, Mimi still stores your progress and links it
          to your browser with a session cookie.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>How information is used</h2>
        <p>
          Mimi uses this information to create and secure accounts, keep you
          signed in, build lessons for your learning history, save progress,
          show community features, and maintain and improve the service.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>What is public</h2>
        <p>
          Your username, profile information, learning statistics, activity,
          and leaderboard results may be public. Your email address and
          password credential are not displayed publicly.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          Mimi uses a session cookie to recognize your browser, keep you signed
          in, and associate learning progress with you. It is necessary for
          account and progress features to work.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Sharing</h2>
        <p>
          Mimi does not sell personal information or share it for advertising.
          Information may be disclosed when required by law or when reasonably
          necessary to protect the service, its users, or others.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Retention and security</h2>
        <p>
          Information is kept for as long as needed to operate the service and
          maintain your account. Reasonable safeguards are used to protect it,
          but no online service can guarantee complete security.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>
          This policy may be updated as Mimi changes. The date at the top will
          show when the latest version took effect.
        </p>
      </section>
    </article>
  </main>
</AppLayout>
